          "titulo": "Red Grid Tea Towel",
          "descricaoHtml": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">This cotton tea towel brings the kind of understated detail that elevates a kitchen without trying, white ground, red grid pattern, clean and simple. At 15x25\", it's the right size for actually drying things, draping over an oven handle, or tucking into a gift box where texture and tone matter.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">The kind of thing people don't buy for themselves but always love receiving.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>What's Included:</strong> Cotton Tea Towel · 15x25\" · White with red grid pattern</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Perfect For:</strong> Housewarming gift boxes, kitchen-themed bundles, host gifts, and anyone who appreciates the small things done well.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Pairs Well With:</strong> <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https://www.foxblossom.com/collections/foods-and-treats\">Rustic Bakery Flatbread Sourdough</a> · <a href=\"https://www.foxblossom.com/products/raw-clover-honey?_pos=3&amp;_psq=raw&amp;_ss=e&amp;_v=1.0\">Raw Clover Honey</a> · <a href=\"https://www.foxblossom.com/products/olive-wood-curved-spoon?_pos=1&amp;_sid=591cf4e97&amp;_ss=r\">Olive Wood Curved Spoon</a></p>",
